Changelog: 22-11-2026 23:04:04

Fixed. The text of the window's info and hint, the README and the messages of install.sh and run.sh is rewritten to the
writing standard: short sentences, one fact each, no chains with semicolons or colons, and American English. The hint
says "Check" instead of "Tick", the installer says "removed" instead of "uninstalled", and the launcher says "anymore".
No label is renamed and no fact is corrected. Nothing the app does has changed. No test changed.

